# Claude instructions for {{brandName}}

Read and follow `AGENTS.md` before making changes. It is the canonical project guidance.

Karsa skills are installed in `.claude/skills/`. Use the relevant skill for the task,
especially `karsa-site-builder`, `karsa-ui`, `karsa-modules`, `karsa-data`, and
`karsa-content`. Select the preset and install/content/polished tier before editing, and keep
route, migration, seed, media, and content ownership with the module that contributes it.
